Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:05.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Welcome! Here is a quick workflow showing how the league works, from sign-up to earning points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:10.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Step one: enter your first name and last initial for the league board.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:15.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Step two: enter your email address. There is no password: we email you a sign-in link.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:20.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Step three: read the privacy note and tick the box. Only facilitators can see your email.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:25.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Step four: choose whether you are joining as a learner or a volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:31.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Step five: pick the team you would like to join, then tap Complete Registration.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:37.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Finally, open the sign-in link we email you. A facilitator will approve your registration, and then you can start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:48.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every weekday, a short challenge appears, about five to fifteen minutes. Answer by typing, recording a voice note, or uploading a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:54.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your facilitator reviews your effort and awards points. Every submission earns points for your team!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:01:03.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,You can also claim ten bonus points each week by attending in person at the Connect Talent centre, confirmed by your facilitator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:11.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Check the leaderboard anytime to see where you stand. You can track your team ranking and follow individual learner scores.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:15.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,That is the whole workflow! Have fun and enjoy learning!
